WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.600
[Dark orchestral music begins, low and ominous]

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:13.200
[The music swells — drums and strings rise]

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:28.400
[Battle sounds — fire, clashing steel, a great bell tolls]

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:33.000
[The music peaks, then fades]
